---
/**
 * The hero scene layer: the canvas the robot navigates in, plus the veil that
 * keeps overlaid text legible. The scene script self-boots on the #scene canvas
 * (2D LiDAR robot navigation; reduced-quality on low-power, static on reduced-motion).
 */
---

<canvas id="scene" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
<div class="scene-veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<script>
  import '../scripts/scene/index.ts';
</script>
